      "statusChangeNewStatus": "closed",
      "value": "This does not appear to be a bug!\nIt appears you've inadvertently adjusted the size of your VRChat window to something not too useful. You may have to adjust the size of your window back to a normal size. You can do so by holding down Shift as you launch the application. Select a resolution and ensure Windowed mode is enabled. This will reset the dimensions of your VRChat window.\nAlternately, you can simply resize the window. You may have to open your main menu to retain control of your mouse.\nNotably, if you find you've accidentally grabbed the edge of your VRChat window, you can cancel the resize by hitting Escape before clicking again/releasing the mouse click.",
